</section>
<section id="A10" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix J </span>Generality</h2>

<div id="A10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To further validate the effectiveness of our dynamic modulation mechanism, we integrated it into STORM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite>, a recent efficient transformer-based world model. As shown in the results below, this integration also leads to clear performance gain.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A10.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A10.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A10.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Game scores in the DeepMind Proprio benchmark.</span></figcaption>
